{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "37a68bc4b21d5b9d97effadb6c440ac21c06c07101440e5c36d98051ea6deb7b", "ja": "（孤島サスペンスホラー映画『誰ソ彼ノ淵』の撮影が\n始まった。監督の高い要求に、みんな苦戦している）", "zh": "（孤岛悬疑恐怖电影《谁彼其黄昏之渊》的拍摄开始了。面对导演的高要求，大家都很是苦战。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1001_p", "source_sha256": "85546f8ec07b07d5884b0371bd86bd70be0c4a0fd125c2df878900161e53629e", "ja": "（今日は夜まで出番がないはずの歌織さんも、\n様子が気になるのか茜達の撮影を見学していた）", "zh": "（本来歌织小姐要到晚上才有戏份，但可能是有些在意情况，也来参观茜她们的拍摄了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "b149d75d827addb4854f07ca29c177243baeb7e97926d60bbfca6745fb1024e8", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n……監督さん、厳しい方ですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n……导演先生，真是位严格的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b638e0a0e72eff11783437936f212eecf160d8da8f4eb4561086fcb96f43ee79", "ja": "お疲れさまです、歌織さん。\nええ、なかなか大変そうです。", "zh": "辛苦了，歌织。\n嗯，看起来相当辛苦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "84b69310442c450d3375cb8c933d5a97e74f32046ac23d7d9854a58cf46e5f8e", "ja": "私なりに、いろいろとホラーの役作りをしてきた\nつもりなんですけど……難しいかもしれません。", "zh": "我自认为已经按照自己的方式做了各种恐怖角色的准备……但可能还是很难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "6ea7fb493fd990159415f32ee1ed1c40e421dcadcec071c8947395552fc1fdf8", "ja": "気を引き締めて、がんばらないと……。", "zh": "得打起精神来努力才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d2f62f8dda35d46e8d177037822bbbf796df2dcbafa562d9bd7deb2af8c52c4e", "ja": "ホラーの役作り……というと、\nどんな事をしてきたんですか？", "zh": "为了塑造恐怖片的角色……这么说来，\n你都做了些什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "b790d78cc8433d87e77ae4a65b2a3552320865b6eb1681a8309e77716111ee46", "ja": "私、ホラーやサスペンスにはあまり詳しくなくて。\n映画に相応しい雰囲気を出すにはどうすればいいかと。", "zh": "我对恐怖片和悬疑片不太了解。\n就在想，要怎么做才能营造出适合电影的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "6ac9b0a0a2c9561fc3022c03d01b0328f6d9d66b81c545a7a913f817a54062b6", "ja": "このみさんや莉緒ちゃんに相談したら、\nそれなら映画を観た方がいいって言われて……。", "zh": "我去找木实姐和莉绪商量，她们说那样的话，还是去看电影比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "9ecc6d252c811fed9d3a20ed085fca15a5ae099fd0046750ec2722df4772fac7", "ja": "それで、風花ちゃんや麗花ちゃんも一緒に、\n泊りがけでホラー映画をたくさん見たんです。", "zh": "于是，我还和风花、小丽花一起，住了一晚看了好多恐怖电影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "1042111af719d91ac5784bd84b042d268c86a3f3cab054b290dc3802169ac933", "ja": "そう、たくさん……。", "zh": "对，看了很多……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9893b3a3023a3a90d6336eb524f2658e3bcbaa0a49461965fd53f8d08b6e909d", "ja": "そ、そうだったんですね。\n……合宿の成果は出せそうですか？", "zh": "原来……是这样啊。\n……集训的成果，看来能展现出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "7941dc350f494bf6c331e9563507db719f7f9130ba83bd6acbed0ab5ab1e9f7b", "ja": "そうですね……すこしだけですけど、\n怖いものに慣れたかもしれません。", "zh": "是啊……虽然只是一点点，但我可能已经稍微习惯恐怖的东西了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "797123af40aedf85ad0246e884f2c1145426e17d665b379830f6999eea1fd755", "ja": "最初は、幽霊が出たり、血飛沫が上がる度に\n悲鳴を上げていたんですけど……。", "zh": "一开始，每次出现幽灵或者血花四溅的时候，\n我都会尖叫……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "255f32d0bb522f39bc6a815929d749660b9f96a9588a4eefe51fec68a4ec6a23", "ja": "風花ちゃんが「今のは静脈だから、助かると思う」って\n解説してくれたりして、だいぶ怖くなくなりました♪", "zh": "风花还会给我讲解，说“刚才那个是静脉，所以我想应该能活下来”之类的，我也就没那么害怕了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a1c8bf503ebdf413e131898a2599b6c38e8752e8e66c0749c60966a565ed5b6f", "ja": "そうですか、風花が……ホラー本来の楽しみ方とは\n大分違う気がしますが、慣れたなら良かったです。", "zh": "这样啊，风花她……感觉和恐怖作品本来的享受方式大不一样，不过既然你已经习惯了，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "439613a6bc3ea5d1c53da12b45d5ac7d4ef57fb783aba8f26797f24b3b1c17b4", "ja": "はい。なので、撮影で血飛沫を浴びても、\n悲鳴を上げたりしないと思います！", "zh": "是的。所以就算拍摄时被飞溅的鲜血溅到，我想我也不会发出尖叫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2819557a4890e7dcc4f73cd4f6e2d54aca80b00716af040a1010e49ca34a326e", "ja": "でも、歌織さんの役は驚いて悲鳴を上げる側ですよね。\n……なら、素直に悲鳴を上げてもいいんじゃ？", "zh": "不过，歌织小姐饰演的角色是受到惊吓、发出惨叫的那一方吧。\n……既然如此，直接叫出来不也挺好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "10b5cfe5b30698ed881a8072c95d7f95a988427e27130d91ffe418ba1179a00f", "ja": "え？　……あっ！", "zh": "咦？……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "3bd827b0995c4200af03183e30dc7dc2dc4588f852467fec7f91e1c86e2f82c6", "ja": "そ、そうでしたね……私の役は、\n驚かないといけないんでした……。", "zh": "对、对哦……我的角色是，\n必须表现得惊讶才行……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "7dac555aa2063d2efc8fd35276baacb9360acf41e4b176fa0ce5a2782cf9219b", "ja": "あの……ど、どうしましょう？\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "那个……怎、怎么办才好？\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_052kao0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_052kao0143_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5352fee9600ddc9a104ee984f657123d9bee6d683197d67760ca6d86878faa28", "ja": "（歌織さんは困ったように聞いてくる。\nこの素直さがあれば、大丈夫だろう……たぶん！）", "zh": "（歌织小姐一脸为难地问我。只要有这份坦率，应该就没问题吧……大概！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
